  lines:
  - english: The supplies are here. I can keep the evacuation equipment running.
    vietnamese: "Ti\u1EBFp t\u1EBF \u0111\xE3 v\u1EC1. T\xF4i c\xF3 th\u1EC3 duy
      tr\xEC thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB ph\u1EE5c v\u1EE5 s\u01A1 t\xE1n."
  - english: Good work. Protect the people still inside the shelter.
    vietnamese: "L\xE0m t\u1ED1t l\u1EAFm. H\xE3y b\u1EA3o v\u1EC7 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      d\xE2n c\xF2n \u1EDF trong n\u01A1i tr\xFA \u1EA9n."
